# 1. WHAT ARE COOKIES?
Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit a website. They allow the website to remember your actions and preferences over a period of time.

# 2. TYPES OF COOKIES WE USE

## 2.1 Technical Cookies (Necessary)
These are essential for the website to function. They do not require consent.
- Session cookies to maintain navigation
- Language preference cookies

## 2.2 Analytics Cookies
These help us understand how users interact with the website.
- **Google Analytics** (if used): For visit statistics
- **Duration:** Up to 2 years
- **Purpose:** To improve website performance

## 2.3 Third-Party Cookies
- **Netlify:** For website hosting
- **MailerLite:** For the newsletter subscription form

# 3. COOKIE MANAGEMENT
You can control and/or delete cookies as desired. You can delete all cookies that are already on your computer and configure most browsers to prevent them from being installed.

**Browser settings:**
- **Chrome:** Settings > Privacy and security > Cookies
- **Firefox:** Preferences > Privacy & Security
- **Safari:** Preferences > Privacy
- **Edge:** Settings > Cookies and site permissions

# 4. CONSENT
By continuing to browse this website, you accept the use of cookies in accordance with this policy.

